<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>系列 on Fragments of Logic</title><link>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/</link><description>Recent content in 系列 on Fragments of Logic</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Kubernetes 核心概念</title><link>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/kubernetes-core/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/kubernetes-core/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;从&amp;quot;容器是进程&amp;quot;这个第一性原理出发，重建 Kubernetes 的核心心智模型：每个字段最终是在跟调度器、kubelet 还是内核对话。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AI 工程</title><link>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/ai-engineering/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/ai-engineering/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;记录 AI 能力进入企业后端系统的过程：编程模型、流式协议、工具调用边界与治理。关注工程边界，而不是 Demo 效果。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>平台工程笔记</title><link>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/platform-notes/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/series/platform-notes/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;平台问题常随范围扩大而变成边界问题。这里记录责任应该落在哪里、平台究竟应该统一什么的推理过程，与&lt;a href="https://libaoxuan-neil.github.io/about/"&gt;关于页&lt;/a&gt;的四项工程观对应。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>